<title>USA: Mosinee approves 3-for-2 split, div hike.</title>
<headline>Mosinee approves 3-for-2 split, div hike.</headline>
<dateline>MOSINEE, Wis. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mosinee Paper Corp said Thursday its board approved a three-for-two stock split payable May 15 to holders of record on May 1.</p>
<p>Directors also approved payment on May 15 to holders of record May 1 of a cash dividend of $0.07 per share following the split. It said payment of the cash dividend following the split will increase total shareholder dividends by 31 percent.</p>
<p>Mosinee had been paying a quarterly dividend of $0.08 per share, presplit.</p>
<p>Mosinee produces technical specialty papers serving industries ranging from consumer electronic products to automotive and food processing.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
